<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 12-month T-bill yield rises to 20.37 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 12-month T-bill yield rises to 20.37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of 12-month discount Treasury bills was set by auction at 20.37 percent, up from 20.35 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     38,869.79 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   18,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		21,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.37 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     83.1929 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
